                $this->q('Two populations of the same ancestral species, separated for a very long time on different islands, have accumulated enough genetic differences that they can no longer interbreed successfully if reunited. This is best described as an example of:', ['Genetic drift with no speciation', 'Speciation via reproductive isolation (allopatric speciation)', 'A single unchanged species', 'Convergent evolution'], 1, 5, 'Long-term geographic isolation has led to full reproductive isolation, i.e. speciation.'),
            ],
